      "translations": {
        "en": "A number of our companions, from Sahl ibn Ziyad, and Muhammad ibn Yahya, from Ahmad ibn Muhammad, and Ali ibn Ibrahim, from his father, altogether from Al-Hasan ibn Mahboub, from Ali ibn Ra'ab, from Zurara, from Abu Ja'far (peace be upon him), that he said:"
